meta {
  name: Paper Trading
  seq: 6
}

docs {
  Failure modes for /v1/paper-accounts/* and paper-destination /v1/webhooks/*.
  Covers: account limit (403), delete while in use (409), webhook with
  both/neither destination (400), signal missing price (async rejection),
  invalid `type` (400, synchronous), PRICE_UPDATE wrong secret (401).

  Prerequisite: run Paper Trading → create-account → create-webhook first
  (in that order) so `paperAccountId`/`paperWebhookId`/`paperWebhookToken` are
  set and the account/webhook actually exist for these negative tests to hit.
}
